fix: legacy no resolve asset urls

<!-- Thank you for contributing! -->

### Description

fix: #9530
fix: #9246

<!-- Please insert your description here and provide especially info about the "what" this PR is solving -->

css-post plugin ignore processed vite asset flag.

>  __VITE_ASSET__ and __VITE_PUBLIC_ASSET__ urls are processed by the vite:asset plugin, don't call resolveAssetUrlsInCss here

If the css load by [user normal plugins (vue plugin)](https://github.com/vitejs/vite/blob/b9130cc910b794b95a4b5ee545e80b2e219dc266/packages/vite/src/node/plugins/index.ts#L83-L87) will break the rule.

so we should `resolveAssetUrlsInCss` in legacy mode. 

